oy more, witness entropy at its worst in digital-brutalist cityscapes. Build to destroy.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Czech, Hungarian", "reviews": "“Tearing down Abriss' beautiful brutalist tower blocks never gets old”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“Abriss is a fun game (anytime you get to smash and blow things up is always fun)”<br>Zeepond<br><br>“ABRISS is a vivid example of the fact that even in the puzzle genre, where dry numbers serve as the foundation, having a catchy design will be a huge plus.”<br>BlahTherapy<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/header.jpg?t=1741102773", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741102773", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741102773", "website": "https://abrissgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-4430<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 970 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any<br>